# Round 2: cross the border to Tijuana, bank at an out-of-network ATM, hop to Cozumel and Los Cabos.
@seed 11
D A L1 L START A
# FLY: the tab opens on the USA; R1 is the MEXICO tab, Tijuana is its first place
R1 R1 R A R1
@shot fly-mexico-tab
A
@shot tijuana-arrival
A A A A
# BANK: no branches across the border, so every deposit pays the fee. Deposit $500.
R A
@shot bank-tijuana
A L L U U U U U
@shot deposit-dial
A
@shot deposit-fee
B
# ride to Zona Rio; the chemist's offer card comes up, B passes
L L A D A
A
@shot offer-card
B
# on to Cozumel
R A
@shot fly-cozumel
A A
# withdraw everything at the Cozumel ATM: the fee again
R A R A Y
@shot withdraw-dial
A
@shot withdraw-fee
B
# fly to Los Cabos (the second place), read the cards
L A D
@shot fly-loscabos
A
@shot loscabos-arrival
A A
# try the border the other way: the ticket costs more than the cash
A L1 A
@shot flight-denied
B
# ride a panga to Medano Beach
L A D A
@shot loscabos-medano
A
@shot loscabos-market
